msgstr ""

#. module: google_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/google_connector/wizard/setup.py:0
msgid ""
"%(audience)s: User type External, then Publish app so the status reads In "
"production. Stay in production: in Testing, Google ends the sign-in every 7 "
"days. Google then shows \"Google hasn't verified this app\" once at sign-in:"
" Advanced › Go to the app; that is expected for your own app."
msgstr ""

#. module: google_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/google_connector/wizard/setup.py:0
msgid ""
