"support email, and this site's domain under Authorized domains."
msgstr ""

#. module: google_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/google_connector/wizard/setup.py:0
msgid "%(client)s: Application type Web application, any name (e.g. Odoo)."
msgstr ""

#. module: google_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/google_connector/wizard/setup.py:0
msgid ""
"%(credentials)s: Create credentials › API key. Restrict it: API restrictions"
" to the Maps APIs of step 3; Application restrictions to Websites, this "
"site's domain(s) only. Browsers see the key (address search): the "
"restriction is what protects it."
msgstr ""

#. module: google_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/google_connector/wizard/setup.py:0
msgid ""
"%(scopes)s: Add or remove scopes › Manually add scopes: paste the WHOLE box "
"below (every scope, comma-separated), Add to table, Update, Save. A scope "
"missing here makes Google refuse the sign-in."
msgstr ""

